# SYNTHETIC. Mail arrived after the last sync pass and before this watch began: SELECT reports a
# UIDNEXT above the one the client synced to (5), so the walk ends without IDLE. IDLE would only
# announce mail arriving while it runs, and this message would wait for the next wake-up.
S: * OK ready
C: a001 EXAMINE "INBOX"
S: * 7 EXISTS
S: * OK [UIDVALIDITY 42] valid
S: * OK [UIDNEXT 8] next
S: a001 OK [READ-ONLY] done
DONE
